{"title":"2005 IMO Shortlist Problems/A3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(<i>Czech Republic</i>)\nFour real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/2/f72f1bf7049da409c8d6239b4cb7b081bd6c31c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle p,q,r,s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"11\" /> satisfy\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/5/a85c0b40d27f2345b73cbf241d2b9cad56d4b786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle p+q+r+s = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"17\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/499ddcea127b326da406ddef06b5f5c7ecbc1e6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle p^2 + q^2 + r^2 + s^2 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"174\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44d113ab6c2f96bf6a82b0d3b44aac989a01013.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab-cd \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /> holds for some permutation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d85ce5ca613ced13fdf590ffd3aebbb6c968b0be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/0/dc09794bae4cb68546eaf04809ded6eb9aed1b5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (p,q,r,s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Lemma.</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4fc459f915b9194ceeb810d5a88084e70f45d1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max (p,q,r,s) \\le 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><i>Proof.</i>  Suppose on the contrary that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/3/8437e1b1294378b7f0a667ffc66215648662ec71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1cec209a199f0dbf1d227d06549ab58128c98ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,q,r,s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Majorize\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Majorize\">majorizes</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd7bae82dabaa0f373de14f13498a5cac523b47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,2,2,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/6/0e6507c190e56b0a1b32a14a938d13825afefc56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f : x \\mapsto x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Convex_function\" title=\"Convex function\">convex function</a>, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Karamata%27s_Inequality\" title=\"Karamata&#39;s Inequality\">Karamata's Inequality</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e362ba770caab2d68a7c04df327b46dc11fcac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21 = p^2+q^2+r^2+s^2 \\ge 3^2 + 2^2 + 2^2 + 2^2 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"372\" height=\"18\" />.  But since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is strictly convex, equality occurs only when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1cec209a199f0dbf1d227d06549ab58128c98ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p,q,r,s)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> is a permutation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd7bae82dabaa0f373de14f13498a5cac523b47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,2,2,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" />, a contradiction, since we assumed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/4843d240c7b2c54b45cfc9ed28b13887dfd36adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />.  <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Halmos&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Halmos (page does not exist)\">Template:Halmos</a>\n</p><p>Without loss of generality, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f96389c82e182915d3211d914d057edc34277a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\ge q,r,s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />.  Now, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/0/29040668a65c7e188e801c42ec86103a788cca76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f : x \\mapsto x(9-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" /> is increasing on the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08f3e0e01c653d0774700cda5749f0167fe92609.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$( -\\infty, 9/2 ]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />,\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/3/933c9bf9c3dbb7cac8d5ff8bc45c4e893105f7eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq + pr + ps = p(9-p) \\ge 3(9-3) = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"316\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Also, we note\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/1314886aecc904b780d915521eec41b30b9c2a6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq+pr+ps+rs+qs+rq = \\frac{1}{2}[ (p+q+r+s)^2 - (p^2+q^2+r^2+s^2) ] = \\frac{1}{2} ( 9^2 - 21) = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"706\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Hence\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef6616cbaf19a9ee0ce5c5b2fe310cc402c572de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(pq-rs) + (pr-qs) + (ps-rq) = 2(pq+pr+ps) - (pq+pr+ps+rs+qs+rq) \\ge 2\\cdot 18 - 30 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"795\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>It follows that at least one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/7/dd726ed3cbcc8c14d54c206bb6ee0fa5524833d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(pq-rs), (pr-qs), (ps-rq)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"229\" height=\"18\" /> must be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Without loss of generality, we assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cb9e04fc9b943d8e8179df44b54490fd234f8b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\ge q \\ge r \\ge s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><b>Lemma.</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d041a81ce96e9f0774851a05307615901d0cf0f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p + q \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><i>Proof 1.</i>  By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rearrangement_Inequality\" title=\"Rearrangement Inequality\">Rearrangement Inequality</a>,\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/38248a6142b99372688b17e111923a3c07c84be8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq + sr \\ge pr + sq = pr + qs \\ge ps + qr$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"302\" height=\"15\" />. </center>\n<p>As in the first solution, we see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/12057199db6bffc921fcb1832124008ee673c881.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (pq+rs) + (pr+sq) + (ps+qr) = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"300\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/2888af3985e02ba24aba185c4b24dfe24bb45007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq + rs \\ge 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" />.  It follows that\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/3/8732e51cddde14d29188916265832dccd90a2227.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p+q)^2 + [9-(p+q)]^2 = (p+q)^2 + (r+s)^2 = p^2+q^2+r^2+s^2 + 2(pq+rs) \\ge 41$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"656\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>This is equivalent to\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/c/c4c2b0c9c0278c5f6d97544c8b52a4928550ca58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p+q-4)(p+q-5) \\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"18\" />, </center>\n<p>so either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67fcba491f0a23732c6ae9b780db3290d5aa68f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/6/126111d22c446249042a6dca308b8e43dfd88d8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q \\le 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />.  But since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/8991a3cbdd3dd021c868313258bcbf7efebb1cc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(p+q) \\ge p+q+r+s = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"222\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9baec9bd103554f963dd668726b8f97b22bb6813.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle p+q \\ge 9/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67fcba491f0a23732c6ae9b780db3290d5aa68f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />.  <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Halmos&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Halmos (page does not exist)\">Template:Halmos</a>\n</p><p><i>Proof 2.</i> From the identity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d98dda0db2e68d16f3bd21723245168b9f5dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (x+y)^2 + (x-y)^2 = 2(x^2+y^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"252\" height=\"19\" /> we have\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/4/1b46f70b267fbafe556fdd85994701ce69a2d058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (p+q+r+s)^2+ (p+q-r-s)^2 + (p+r-q-s)^2 + (p+s-q-r)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"558\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/6/b06bec9d6dce87fc8fddb37826090e17458fecee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle = 2[(p+q)^2 + (r+s)^2 + (p-q)^2 + (r-s)^2]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"348\" height=\"20\" /><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/8/6f80b6ee8400bcdec60633ce88c5c90410f87f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle = 2[ 2(p^2+q^2) + 2(r^2+s^2) ] = 84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"258\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71b9f08c796fa052eb9106309b46825951329c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle (p+q+r+s)^2 = 81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"164\" height=\"19\" />, this implies\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8f793450ad69adc4c686854eb608b0a425aa5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p+q-r-s)^2 + (p+r-q-s)^2 + (p+s-q-r)^2 \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"447\" height=\"19\" />, </center>\n<p>and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a105a07a4fb9870623d3def74197749de6364182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p+q-r-s)^2 \\ge (p+r-q-s)^2, (p+s-q-r)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"404\" height=\"21\" />, this gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/d/8bdb452b35cff4d6030a2d2182faef0c8d7a9eb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p+q-r-s)^2 \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"19\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/6/73684053b04fa378b60235f69799f4467622f521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q -r-s \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />.  Thus\n</p>\n<center>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/d/f0db7d0de2194493f32a54ddc69c20ff6092a0ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(p+q) -9 = p+q+ (p+q-9) = p+q-r-s \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"425\" height=\"18\" />,</center>\n<p>so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67fcba491f0a23732c6ae9b780db3290d5aa68f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q \\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />.  <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:Halmos&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Halmos (page does not exist)\">Template:Halmos</a>\n</p><p>Now,\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b715e74afdcd3fa5b5352a4deb6eb0acfee8764f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21 + 2(pq-rs) = (p+q)^2 + (r-s)^2 \\ge 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"332\" height=\"19\" />,\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/9/689a7ccc68229f112f92136673e7e7c2b8660e4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$pq-rs \\ge 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />, as desired.\n</p><p><br />\n<i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2005_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A3&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_IMO_Shortlist_Problems\" title=\"2005 IMO Shortlist Problems\">2005 IMO Shortlist Problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=100731\">Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018051146\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 279/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 413/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9696/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.703      1 -total\n 39.50%    5.412      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n 16.76%    2.296      3 Template:Halmos\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5022:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018051146 and revision id 99551. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}